{{Passive skill box|One Step Ahead}}

'''One Step Ahead''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Trickster]] that sets the user's [[action speed]] minimum to 90% and nearby monsters' maximum action speed to 90%.

==Mechanics==
This passive affects modifiers to [[action speed]], such as [[Tailwind]] and [[Chill]]. Effects that can set the user's action speed to 0% such as [[Freeze]] and [[Petrify]] will have its effects greatly mitigated, allowing to benefit from self-freeze mechanics or {{il|Replica Rumi's Concoction}} at a much lower downside. It also mitigates the action speed reduction of {{il|Temporal Chains}} without affecting the slower [[expiration rate]] of various effects, making it useful for self-curse builds.  

It does not affect [[Movement Speed]] slows like [[Maim]] and [[Hinder]].

Note that the slow effect only applies to enemy [[monster]]s, and will not affect other players in a [[PVP]] setting.

The [[distance]] of the slowing aura is 60 units.

